      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOCIAL OUTING (1) produced a strong performance last time when he battled on bravely to just miss out over 1780m at this track. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. SWEDESBORO (8) turned in a poor effort by her standards last time out when 35 metres away in seventh over 1780m at this track. Form prior to that had been solid. Beautifully placed and is sure to prove tough to beat. KIPCHOGE (9) broke last start but still managed to fill a minor placing over 1850m at Marburg, finishing 35 metres from the winner. That was a pleasing progression after missing the placings the run before. Has the talent to make his presence felt. MULLUM PATSY (2) is at the track for the first time. By Changeover and hails from the Matt Crone stable. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Showed some ability when a minor placegetter in a recent trial. Watch the late betting on her to get a better guide.",
